# Credentials and local secrets (defense in depth for contributors)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
# Auto-update signing key (round 7): the private key is updater.key (covered
# by *.key); its password sits next to it. Both live ONLY on the owner's
# machine and in the GitHub secrets. The .pub is public and may be committed.
scripts/brand/updater.key.password
models.json
vault.bin
chat.db
chat.db-*
tools-audit.log
# Signing material (audit C5): Apple .p12 / App Store Connect .p8, Windows
# .pfx / .cer. They belong in the GitHub secrets, never in the tree.
*.p12
*.p8
*.pfx
*.cer
